    "The global repair model-process reserve is exhausted by v188 and v205; its single abort-control reserve is exhausted by v206. Resource dimensions are accounted independently.",
    "v209 loaded the Front model and completed one W0 request, then the inherited uniform-only path validator rejected the legal q512-then-q0 cross-layer Hybrid topology. The immutable FAIL was archived; a test-first validator repair gets a new v223 identity and consumes an A slot because the global repair reserve is exhausted.",
